**Ref:** Peruma et al., CASCON 2019 — *Assertion Roulette*
**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 70) — *same test as Smell 6*

```csharp
// ❌ SMELL: 3 assertions, none with a message — which one failed?
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);
```

**Fix — add assertion messages:**
```csharp
