### Smell-Free Test ✅

`ValidateOrder_NullOrder_ThrowsArgumentNullException` (line 155) is well-structured:

- Single production method under test
- Uses MSTest's `Assert.ThrowsException<T>` (no manual try/catch)
- Asserts on a specific property (`ParamName`)
- No external dependencies, magic numbers, or conditional logic

This is the pattern the rest of the suite should follow.

